# Options: release || development (default is development when omitted)
# PLEC_CLI_VERSION selects which CLI the `plec` binary contains: `release`
# builds the app CLI, anything else keeps the dev CLI.
# The value is lifted from `.env.plec` and baked in at compile time by
# crates/plec-cli/build.rs, so changing it requires rebuilding:
#   cargo build -p plec-cli
# PLEC_CLI_VERSION='development'
